<title>INDONESIA: Indonesia's Suharto flies to Turkey for summit.</title>
<headline>Indonesia's Suharto flies to Turkey for summit.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indonesia's President Suharto left for Turkey on Friday to attend a summit meeting of eight Islamic countries. He will return on June 16.</p>
<p>Other nations attending the summit include Bangladesh, Egypt, Iran, Malaysia, Nigeria, Pakistan and Turkey.</p>
<p>Suharto was accompanied by State Secretary Murdiono, Foreign Minister Ali Alatas and other senior officials.</p>
